OL,3,ABritish Museum bans visitors from
OL,4,Aphotographing Bayeux Tapestry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Museum has banned visitors
OL,7,Ffrom taking photographs of the Bayeux
OL,8,FTapestry over concerns that they were
OL,9,Ftaking too long to view the historic
OL,10,Fwork.
OL,12,FCurators had initially allowed photos
OL,13,Fto be taken but reversed that decision
OL,14,Fafter long queues delayed
OL,15,Fticket-holders from accessing the
OL,16,Fexhibition.
OL,18,FThe medieval embroidery, which is on
OL,19,Fdisplay in Britain for the first time,
OL,20,Fdepicts the events leading up to the
OL,21,FNorman conquest of England and the
OL,22,FBattle of Hastings in 1066.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
