OL,3,ABritish Museum bans visitors from
OL,4,Aphotographing Bayeux Tapestry
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors are being allowed into the
OL,7,Fsold-out exhibit in groups every 40
OL,8,Fminutes and told to keep moving along
OL,9,Fthe 68m (230ft) work in one direction.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
